### Base Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@authToken = 1|laravel_sanctum_token_here...

### 1. Register a New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "User Testing",
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "password_confirmation": "password123"
}

### 2. Login User
# After running this, copy the token from the response and paste it into @authToken above.
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get Authenticated User Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get List of Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Filter Tickets by Status/Priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets?status=open&priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create a New Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "category_id": 1,
    "title": "Koneksi Internet Putus di Lantai 2",
    "description": "Tidak bisa terhubung ke Wi-Fi kantor sejak pagi hari.",
    "priority": "high"
}

### 7. Get Ticket Detail (Replace {ticket_id} with actual ticket ID/UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Add Comment to Ticket (Replace {ticket_id} with actual ticket ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "message": "Terima kasih, mohon bantuannya segera diperiksa."
}

### 9. Logout User
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
